    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0010",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "Streamed audio file data is expected to be passed to the parser in the same sequence in which it appears in the audio file, from the beginning of the audio file stream, without gaps.",
      "normalizedSource": "Streamed audio file data is expected to be passed to the parser in the same sequence in which it appears in the audio file, from the beginning of the audio file stream, without gaps.",
      "sourceHash": "72bd5f52524613dc603743c339841814c9010d4d002b75801ae8133bc764f66a",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "However, if you called the [`AudioFileStreamSeek(_:_:_:_:)`](audiofilestreamseek(_:_:_:_:).md) function, the parser assumes that the data passed to the [`AudioFileStreamParseBytes(_:_:_:_:)`](audiofilestreamparsebytes(_:_:_:_:).md) function starts from the byte offset returned by the [`AudioFileStreamSeek(_:_:_:_:)`](audiofilestreamseek(_:_:_:_:).md) function.",
      "documentTitle": "AudioFileStreamParseBytes(::::)",
      "framework": "AudioToolbox",
      "ko": "",
      "status": "failed",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0002",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0010",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "However, if you called the [`AudioFileStreamSeek(_:_:_:_:)`](audiofilestreamseek(_:_:_:_:).md) function, the parser assumes that the data passed to the [`AudioFileStreamParseBytes(_:_:_:_:)`](audiofilestreamparsebytes(_:_:_:_:).md) function starts from the byte offset returned by the [`AudioFileStreamSeek(_:_:_:_:)`](audiofilestreamseek(_:_:_:_:).md) function.",
      "normalizedSource": "However, if you called the [`AudioFileStreamSeek(_:_:_:_:)`](audiofilestreamseek(_:_:_:_:).md) function, the parser assumes that the data passed to the [`AudioFileStreamParseBytes(_:_:_:_:)`](audiofilestreamparsebytes(_:_:_:_:).md) function starts from the byte offset returned by the [`AudioFileStreamSeek(_:_:_:_:)`](audiofilestreamseek(_:_:_:_:).md) function.",
      "sourceHash": "fa331aa8503382fc8ae689319e135a7a69c0d0ac8d5496157f52880ab79f8189",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Streamed audio file data is expected to be passed to the parser in the same sequence in which it appears in the audio file, from the beginning of the audio file stream, without gaps.",
      "contextAfter": "When you provide data to the parser, the parser looks for property data and audio data packets and, when it has data ready, calls your [`AudioFileStream_PropertyListenerProc`](audiofilestream_propertylistenerproc.md) and [`AudioFileStream_PacketsProc`](audiofilestream_packetsproc.md) callback functions to process the data.",
      "documentTitle": "AudioFileStreamParseBytes(::::)",
      "framework": "AudioToolbox",
      "ko": "",
